WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:09.802
Gildong watched the royal police come through the gate.

2
00:00:09.803 --> 00:00:15.597
Mok puffed out his chest. "We can beat these guys!"

3
00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:20.963
"If we make a scene, the town gates will close," Gildong said.

4
00:00:20.964 --> 00:00:24.442
"Everyone split up and get back to the hideout quickly.

5
00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:27.237
I'll distract the royal police."

6
00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:36.067
"As you say, boss," Mok said.

7
00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:42.166
The police headed toward the jail.

8
00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:47.348
Gildong followed them.

9
00:00:47.349 --> 00:00:51.718
"You let those prisoners go?"

10
00:00:51.719 --> 00:00:55.338
Police Chief Heup roared at the guard.

11
00:00:55.339 --> 00:00:58.924
"The governor gave the order." The guard shrugged.

12
00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.606
"A messenger had a scroll."

13
00:01:01.607 --> 00:01:04.507
"You fool," the chief said.

14
00:01:04.508 --> 00:01:19.541
"The Hwalbindang tricked you so easily! I'll capture them."

15
00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:27.679
Gildong followed the police out of town.

16
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:39.421
When they got to the mountain, he opened his fan. "Illusion."

17
00:01:39.422 --> 00:01:42.045
Heup led his men up a road.

18
00:01:42.046 --> 00:01:52.797
They traveled for hours.

19
00:01:52.798 --> 00:01:56.272
At last he saw an inn.

20
00:01:56.273 --> 00:02:01.462
"We'll stop and rest," he said.

21
00:02:01.463 --> 00:02:04.719
The soldiers ate dinner.

22
00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:07.971
Meanwhile a boy came in.

23
00:02:07.972 --> 00:02:11.069
He sat next to Heup.

24
00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:16.747
"Are you looking for Hong Gildong?" the boy whispered.

25
00:02:16.748 --> 00:02:21.860
Heup nodded. "Do you know where the Hwalbindang hideout is?"

26
00:02:21.861 --> 00:02:24.452
"Of course," the boy said.

27
00:02:24.453 --> 00:02:28.009
"In fact, I've been looking for a strong man like you.

28
00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:33.250
You can help me capture Hong Gildong. Follow me."

29
00:02:33.251 --> 00:02:37.901
Heup looked around the inn. "What about my men?"

30
00:02:37.902 --> 00:02:43.406
The boy frowned. "You look strong, but your men don't.

31
00:02:43.407 --> 00:02:45.735
Hong Gildong is really powerful.

32
00:02:45.736 --> 00:02:53.125
It's safer if we go by ourselves."

33
00:02:53.126 --> 00:02:59.079
Heup and the boy went deep into the woods.

34
00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:03.595
"We're close to the hideout," the boy said.

35
00:03:03.596 --> 00:03:07.090
"Great! I'll capture Hong Gildong for sure!"

36
00:03:07.091 --> 00:03:12.410
Heup grinned and glanced at the boy, but the boy was gone.

37
00:03:12.411 --> 00:03:16.301
"Police Chief!" a voice rang out.

38
00:03:16.302 --> 00:03:20.760
"Your search for Hong Gildong has angered the Heavens.

39
00:03:20.761 --> 00:03:27.371
You will go to the Land of Darkness to be judged."

40
00:03:27.372 --> 00:03:30.666
Heup looked around.

41
00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:34.487
The woods were empty.

42
00:03:34.488 --> 00:03:41.051
Where had the voice come from? He stood up tall.

43
00:03:41.052 --> 00:03:43.812
"Come out, whoever you are!

44
00:03:43.813 --> 00:03:46.657
I'm not afraid of you! I'm—"

45
00:03:46.658 --> 00:03:49.054
Suddenly everything went black.

46
00:03:49.055 --> 00:03:53.209
Heup was blindfolded!

47
00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:58.334
"Welcome to the Land of Darkness!" the voice boomed.

48
00:03:58.335 --> 00:04:00.571
Heup shook with fear.

49
00:04:00.572 --> 00:04:05.400
"Please let me go! I don't want to be dead!"

50
00:04:05.401 --> 00:04:08.798
"Ha-ha-ha." A boy laughed.

51
00:04:08.799 --> 00:04:11.623
The blindfold was removed.

52
00:04:11.624 --> 00:04:17.270
Heup saw the boy who had led him into the forest.

53
00:04:17.271 --> 00:04:21.226
"I told you Hong Gildong is powerful!" the boy said.

54
00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:23.815
"I should know because . . ."

55
00:04:23.816 --> 00:04:29.823
Heup gasped. "You're Hong Gildong!"

56
00:04:29.824 --> 00:04:34.296
"Yes." Gildong smiled.

57
00:04:34.297 --> 00:04:37.647
"I'm far more powerful than you.

58
00:04:37.648 --> 00:04:44.945
So don't bother trying to capture me!"

